# A FILE FROM AFTER THIS ENGINE.
#
# Version 3 exists somewhere and this engine is version 2. Three of the keys below mean nothing
# to it: it says so, once each, and carries on with the keys it does understand.
#
# THE ALTERNATIVE IS AN ENGINE THAT REFUSES TO OPEN ANYTHING A LATER TOOL TOUCHED, which is how
# a studio's artists end up unable to open their own files after somebody upgrades.

meridian 3

scene future
  camera    16.0 9.0 34.0
  look      0.380 -0.090 72
  tonemap   aces
  exposure  1.0
  bloom     0.60 1.00
  dust      4000 swirl box 30 0.7 1.0
  stars     10000 frozen 1.0 1.0
  volumetric 0.4 0.8 12
  reflections screenspace 24
  decals     3 wet
  note      a version 3 file
end
